        "raw": "<p>The min, mid, or max dice being referenced by those twists don't come from the environment - they specifically mean the dice that were just rolled by the hero.&nbsp;</p><p>So, if a hero rolls a 3, 4, and 5 on an Overcome, the mid result is 4, which means the Overcome succeeds with a minor twist. So, if you select a minor twist that interacts with the min die, that min die result is 3!</p><p>Does that make sense? Hope it helps!</p>",
